{"title":"2025 IOQM/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span id=\"Problem_Statement_.E0.B4.AA.E0.B5.8D.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.B6.E0.B5.8D.E0.B4.A8.E0.B4.B5.E0.B4.BF.E0.B4.B5.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.A3.E0.B4.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_Statement_പ്രശ്നവിവരണം\">Problem Statement പ്രശ്നവിവരണം</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IOQM/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem Statement പ്രശ്നവിവരണം\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is defined on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/0/d4023589a374e5b4a1bc6063d887aec205e0d3e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/6/a063e1f48bc29ffc07d113479e26f77345dd3090.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m,n \\in \\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" /> satisfy\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/3/4e3c5810569ccead8a95d157812425a4a8f71fbc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(mn+1) = f(m)f(n) - f(n) -m + 2\\]\" width=\"311\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/2/cf24e88058a6fdef1dddad3aa7562a7cf7109b32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" />, find the largest integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/2/f9272a82040b36d2fdd6312ccabcc3e469d9f5aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=1}^N f(k) &lt; 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"117\" height=\"56\" />. \n</p><p>ഒരു ഫംഗ്ഷൻ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/0/d4023589a374e5b4a1bc6063d887aec205e0d3e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />-ൽ നിർവചിച്ചിരിക്കുന്നു. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/6/a063e1f48bc29ffc07d113479e26f77345dd3090.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m,n \\in \\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" /> ആയാൽ,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/3/4e3c5810569ccead8a95d157812425a4a8f71fbc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(mn+1) = f(m)f(n) - f(n) -m + 2\\]\" width=\"311\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>എന്ന് തൃപ്തിപ്പെടുത്തുന്നു.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/2/cf24e88058a6fdef1dddad3aa7562a7cf7109b32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" /> ആണെങ്കിൽ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/2/f9272a82040b36d2fdd6312ccabcc3e469d9f5aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=1}^N f(k) &lt; 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"117\" height=\"56\" /> ആയിരിക്കുന്ന ഏറ്റവും വലിയ പൂർണ്ണസംഖ്യ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> കണ്ടെത്തുക.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_.E0.B4.AA.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.BF.E0.B4.B9.E0.B4.BE.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_പരിഹാരം\">Solution പരിഹാരം</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IOQM/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution പരിഹാരം\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/d/81d32f1efbef60a0f933ac4bb7465f2965e197f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 0, n = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/e/04edfdf56f0d7644a2307f89451dacfcff71ce39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) = f(1) - f(1) - 0 + 2 \\implies f(1) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"330\" height=\"20\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/3/393d544e5ea679465924b93fdbe63d4e8a89cf3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=1, n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/a/e8afe9a5dfefec062cd64a3a4716de3139d11dc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) = 4 - 2 - 1 + 2 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"197\" height=\"20\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/5/c0517349ef629f378e5e6b2176d50bc0afe91eed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 2, n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/8/bc8717971c0cdbb3233fe620f1c9d655241bcd3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3) = 3(2) - 2- 2 + 2 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"220\" height=\"20\" />. It appears as if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/1/831e77b3a257697d24f24a2aca1800dc7e1cf4e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(m) = m+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"20\" />. \n</p><p><b>Lemma:</b> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/1/831e77b3a257697d24f24a2aca1800dc7e1cf4e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(m) = m+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"20\" /> for all integral <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>We prove via induction. The base case <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/2/cf24e88058a6fdef1dddad3aa7562a7cf7109b32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" /> holds. For the inductive step assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/5/ab5c31c6c02815105ac0215b0a249c4590bd3699.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(m-1) = f(m)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"139\" height=\"20\" /> and we prove <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/1/831e77b3a257697d24f24a2aca1800dc7e1cf4e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(m) = m+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"20\" />. Then, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/4/10407dede61b6c4c4aa9bbc193304c7c8ecf423f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b \\in \\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/5/bb5ae494dc0faf502b6b1fcb88b3a3f992dc84db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(ab+1) = f(a)f(b) - f(b) - a +2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"285\" height=\"20\" />, then let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/6/466a600a84c6df76ee614b73224e1abc361d09fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = m-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/851b03ce92c3ad8da97daf2785cf4e103c7a8d66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> and notice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/c/d7c07298f1968950796099e3e11d341552b36b51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(m) = f(m-1)f(1) - f(1) - m + 1 + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"331\" height=\"20\" />. Notice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/e/ebe113a800b519c0a4b80803d4fa2be2546015f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/f/eaf942c166340b990618ab504b7e659c01965a46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(m) = 2f(m-1) - m+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"218\" height=\"20\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/4/9d4442ec227d27c5e977da1a00833d79fd40aff0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(m) = 2m - m + 1 \\implies m +1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"258\" height=\"20\" />. Thus, the proof is complete. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbb9e25e5be095e317771a9c5d00877ee9c8012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\blacksquare$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><b>2025 IOQM P14:</b>\n</p><p>We finish this problem:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/f/24fe52f0a588f47b22a04336b1df357621434c7d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{k=1}^N f(k) &lt; 100 = \\sum_{k=1}^N k+1 &lt; 100 = \\frac{N(N+1)}{2} + N &lt; 100\\]\" width=\"457\" height=\"51\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/2/e928286157bc8cc5b8598c0a7bcd07896bddeeb4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N^2 + N + 2N &lt; 200 \\implies N^2 + 3N &lt; 200\\]\" width=\"334\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/6/df6a5a199350e1a731ec1eb3c69057a4819aea44.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N^2 + 3N - 200 &lt; 0\\]\" width=\"153\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/1/4f114f1e38039dedf5a17d3b6f0e28f3ee6104e0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N \\approx 12.72, -15.72\\]\" width=\"144\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>The largest <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/38693a75a9e00c962455566cda9d06d94da1738b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>ആണെങ്കിൽ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/a/e8afe9a5dfefec062cd64a3a4716de3139d11dc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2) = 4 - 2 - 1 + 2 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"197\" height=\"20\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/5/c0517349ef629f378e5e6b2176d50bc0afe91eed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 2, n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"17\" /> ആണെങ്കിൽ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/8/bc8717971c0cdbb3233fe620f1c9d655241bcd3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3) = 3(2) - 2- 2 + 2 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"220\" height=\"20\" />. അതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/1/831e77b3a257697d24f24a2aca1800dc7e1cf4e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(m) = m+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"20\" /> ആണെന്ന് തോന്നുന്നു.\n</p><p><b>ഉപപ്രമേയം:</b> എല്ലാ പൂർണ്ണസംഖ്യകൾക്കും <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/1/831e77b3a257697d24f24a2aca1800dc7e1cf4e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(m) = m+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>നമുക്ക് ഇൻഡക്ഷൻ വഴി തെളിയിക്കാം. അടിസ്ഥാന ഘട്ടത്തിൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/2/cf24e88058a6fdef1dddad3aa7562a7cf7109b32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" /> ശരിയാണ്. ഇൻഡക്ഷൻ ഘട്ടത്തിൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/5/ab5c31c6c02815105ac0215b0a249c4590bd3699.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(m-1) = f(m)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"139\" height=\"20\" /> എന്ന് അനുമാനിച്ച് <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/1/831e77b3a257697d24f24a2aca1800dc7e1cf4e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(m) = m+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"20\" /> എന്ന് തെളിയിക്കാം. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/4/10407dede61b6c4c4aa9bbc193304c7c8ecf423f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b \\in \\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> ആണെന്നും <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/5/bb5ae494dc0faf502b6b1fcb88b3a3f992dc84db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(ab+1) = f(a)f(b) - f(b) - a +2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"285\" height=\"20\" /> തൃപ്തിപ്പെടുത്തുന്നുവെന്നും എടുക്കുക. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/6/466a600a84c6df76ee614b73224e1abc361d09fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = m-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" /> എന്നും <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/851b03ce92c3ad8da97daf2785cf4e103c7a8d66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" /> എന്നും എടുത്താൽ,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/c/d7c07298f1968950796099e3e11d341552b36b51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(m) = f(m-1)f(1) - f(1) - m + 1 + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"331\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/e/ebe113a800b519c0a4b80803d4fa2be2546015f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> ആണെന്ന് ശ്രദ്ധിക്കുക. അതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/f/eaf942c166340b990618ab504b7e659c01965a46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(m) = 2f(m-1) - m+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"218\" height=\"20\" />, അതായത് <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/4/9d4442ec227d27c5e977da1a00833d79fd40aff0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(m) = 2m - m + 1 \\implies m +1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"258\" height=\"20\" />. അതിനാൽ, തെളിവ് പൂർത്തിയായി. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbb9e25e5be095e317771a9c5d00877ee9c8012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\blacksquare$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><b>2025 IOQM P14:</b>\n</p><p>നമുക്ക് ഈ പ്രശ്നം പൂർത്തിയാക്കാം:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc9393bc9f07ae28eaee0fdf4af3dc7b76a798f7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{k=1}^N f(k) &lt; 100 = \\sum_{k=1}^N k+1 &lt; 100 = \\frac{N(N+1)}{2} + N &lt; 100.\\]\" width=\"461\" height=\"51\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/2/e928286157bc8cc5b8598c0a7bcd07896bddeeb4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N^2 + N + 2N &lt; 200 \\implies N^2 + 3N &lt; 200\\]\" width=\"334\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/6/df6a5a199350e1a731ec1eb3c69057a4819aea44.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N^2 + 3N - 200 &lt; 0\\]\" width=\"153\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/9/8c92822b5803aab25c23d8ddf67b4358632b5912.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N \\approx 12.72, -15.72.\\]\" width=\"148\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>അതിനാൽ ഏറ്റവും വലിയ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/38693a75a9e00c962455566cda9d06d94da1738b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" /> ആണ്.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018070514\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 225/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 11914/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37892:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018070514 and revision id 292630. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}